## ✨ <span style="color:#A68A56">Key Features</span>

*   **🌐 Bilingual Intelligence:** Seamless real-time switching between English and Urdu with automatic alignment.
*   **🧠 Smart History:** A persistent "Recents" section to revisit queries without page refreshes.
*   **❓ FAQ Integration:** Guided paths for first-time users regarding common legal procedures.
*   **📱 Responsive Design:** Fully accessible custom sidebar for all mobile and desktop devices.

